{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"球面同伦群"},2],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"同伦论","text":"同伦论"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"球面同伦群"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>球面同伦群的意义在于</p>\n<ul>\n<li>它们作用于空间的任何同伦不变量上;</li>\n<li>在微分拓扑中的应用, 如 "},{"Local":{"url":"Pontryagin–Thom同构","text":"Pontryagin 定理"}},{"Plain":" : (非稳定) $\\pi_{k+n} (S^{n})$ 为 $S^n$ 的标架 $k$ 维子流形的配边群, (稳定) $\\pi_k (\\mathbb S) = \\Omega_k^{\\mathrm{fr}}$ 为稳定标架 $k$-流形的配边群.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}